y", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 19, "letter_url": "/letters/19/"}, {"id": "e165", "source": "letter:19", "target": "place:messina", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 19, "letter_url": "/letters/19/"}, {"id": "e166", "source": "letter:20", "target": "place:china", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I pray now that Your Paternity fulfill the greeting that you lovingly sent, and my desire, which every day grows ever more — and in this time particularly, with news of China and Japan."], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e167", "source": "letter:20", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["I pray now that Your Paternity fulfill the greeting that you lovingly sent, and my desire, which every day grows ever more — and in this time particularly, with news of China and Japan."], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e168", "source": "letter:20", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["The greeting that Your Paternity gave me through one letter to Father Cesare Cosso, then [Vice-Provincial], brought me as much contentment as certain hope of a thing so long desired is wont to bring, for such a greeting "], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e169", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:china-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e170", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e171", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:japan-mission-to", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e172", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:novitiate", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e173", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e174", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:spiritual-exercises", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e175", "source": "letter:20", "target": "topic:studies", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e176", "source": "letter:20", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["To the Lord be that which may make me seek His glory in the Indies, and make happy the government of Your Paternity so well begun."], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e177", "source": "letter:20", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e178", "source": "letter:20", "target": "person:amodei-benedetto", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e179", "source": "letter:20", "target": "place:palermo", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 20, "letter_url": "/letters/20/"}, {"id": "e180", "source": "letter:21", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["But that I should not rise again to make a new petition — that, thrust back, I should not return — I cannot keep myself from doing, my most beloved Father: [mercifully] there will live in me, thanks be to the Lord, the b"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e181", "source": "letter:21", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e182", "source": "letter:21", "target": "topic:tears", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e183", "source": "letter:21", "target": "topic:virgin-mary", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e184", "source": "letter:21", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["You could make me weep, and at times languish, and mortify me so much that not even my name — poor though it be as refreshment for one oppressed — is heard among the others persevering for the Indies in your most loving "], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e185", "source": "letter:21", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e186", "source": "letter:21", "target": "person:alfieri-giuseppe", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e187", "source": "letter:21", "target": "place:messina", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 21, "letter_url": "/letters/21/"}, {"id": "e188", "source": "letter:22", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Having done this up to now, there occurs to me at present another thing, which belongs only to Our Father, our Father: the vocation to the Indies, a very great grace of God, and to be most greatly esteemed.", "Two years before I was admitted to the novitiate, or a little less, hearing talk of the things of the Indies — particularly of the martyrdoms — since from childhood I have always had the vocation to the Company, I felt c"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e189", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:humility", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e190", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:martyrdom", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e191", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:novitiate", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e192", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:obedience", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e193", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:spiritual-exercises", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e194", "source": "letter:22", "target": "topic:xavier-st-francis", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e195", "source": "letter:22", "target": "place:naples", "type": "mentions_place", "label": "mentions", "evidence": ["these movements grew much with the occasion of certain missions which ours were conducting through Naples, with whom I used to go along to help at least to sing through the streets, to draw the people."], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e196", "source": "letter:22", "target": "person:vitelleschi-mutio", "type": "recipient", "label": "addressed to", "evidence": ["addressed"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e197", "source": "letter:22", "target": "person:gargano-francesco", "type": "written_by", "label": "written by", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e198", "source": "letter:22", "target": "place:naples", "type": "written_in", "label": "written in", "evidence": ["byline"], "letter": 22, "letter_url": "/letters/22/"}, {"id": "e199", "source": "letter:23", "target": "place:japan", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Very Reverend Father, Our Father, The great longing which I have always had, and which I now feel within me more than ever, to go to the Indies has moved me to write these four lines to Your Paternity — especially now th"], "letter": 23, "letter_url": "/letters/23/"}, {"id": "e200", "source": "letter:23", "target": "place:the-indies", "type": "aspires_to", "label": "desires to travel to", "evidence": ["Very Reverend Father, Our Father, The great longing which I have always had, and which I now feel within me more than ever, to go to the Indies has moved me to write these four lines to Your Paternity — especially now th"], "letter": 23, "letter_url": "/letters/23/"}, {"id": "e201", "source": "letter:23", "target": "topic:blood-of-christ", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 23, "letter_url": "/letters/23/"}, {"id": "e202", "source": "letter:23", "target": "topic:cross-and-suffering", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 23, "letter_url": "/letters/23/"}, {"id": "e203", "source": "letter:23", "target": "topic:health", "type": "indexed_under", "label": "indexed under", "evidence": ["Index of Topics (printed)"], "letter": 23, "letter_url": "/letters/23/"}, {"id": "e204", "source": "le